{
  "$description": "Foundation contrast pairs (WCAG 2.2 AA): 4.5 for text, 3 for large text and UI components (1.4.3, 1.4.11). Each group is checked as every foreground on every background, in every theme. These are usage relationships, not token values; products check their own pairs against the manifest.",
